title: "BECA — Perfect Recursion / Bidirectional Evolutionary Recursion"
message: "If you discuss or build on BECA, please cite this repository."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "iking-i"
version: "0.7"
date-released: 2026-10-02
repository-code: "https://github.com/iking-i/beca-architecture"
url: "https://github.com/iking-i/beca-architecture"
abstract: >-
  BECA proposes Perfect Recursion, an expanding bidirectional recursive architecture
  in which persistent lower-level processes continue to produce reality-facing
  information, higher-level structures integrate and reconstruct that information,
  and qualitative higher-level changes reshape the quality and structure of later
  lower-level variation. Perception, capacity, local failure, and recursive origins
  can themselves become objects of further recursion.
keywords:
  - perfect recursion
  - bidirectional evolutionary recursion
  - recursive systems
  - open-ended evolution
  - multi-level systems
  - cybernetics
  - recursive origins
  - quantity quality transition
